<description>INACTIVE pending wording approval. Lead Status = Nurture or Interested - Future (not converted): day 0 sends the Lead Source x Status template AK9I_C_&lt;NU|IF&gt;_&lt;Source&gt;; Interested - Future also gets I2 at +60 and I3 at +90 days if still in that status. Nurture follow-ups stay with the existing Nurture Campaign Emails. Every send goes through F0 as marketing/unsolicited.</description>
<environments>Default</environments>
